    "title": "William \"Bill\" Bozzuto - NewsBreak",
    "text": "18 hours ago William “Bill” Bozzuto passed away on June 10, 2026, in Boise, Idaho. He was 80. Bill was born Dec. 2, 1945, in Waterbury, Connecticut, the first child to Victor and Rae Bozzuto. In 1960, Vic and Rae relocated Bill and his siblings Bob, Vicky and Tony to Shoshone, Idaho, where Vic would start the family business Bozzuto Furniture. Read full article",
